# The NSP registry is deployed to a Linux VPS (/opt/nsp) and its shell script,
# systemd unit and nginx config are executed there directly. A CR at the end of
# each line breaks them: bash reads `set -euo pipefail\r` as an invalid option
# name and aborts the installer.
#
# Store and check out this subtree with LF regardless of the machine's
# core.autocrlf setting. Scoped to fintech/NSP so the rest of the repository,
# which is currently CRLF throughout, is left untouched.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be line-ending converted, should any be added later.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.eot  binary
